# Koog's LLM clients look up their HTTP client factory through ServiceLoader. The JVM jar of
# ai.koog:http-client-ktor registers this provider, but its Android AAR (1.2.0) ships without
# the service file, so on Android every client fails with "No KoogHttpClient.Factory provider
# found" and R8 removes AI discovery from the release build as unreachable code.
ai.koog.http.client.ktor.KtorKoogHttpClient$Factory
